WEBVTT

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:12.900
A goblet of sacred wine is offered to the refugees as they head towards Asuka.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:21.610
They gather and talk through the night.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:31.340
The desolate shadows seek...

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:41.430
the dance of a maiden long forgotten.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter Four

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:20.860
How do you feel?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.260
I was dreaming.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.510
What did you dream?

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.300
I am uncertain.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:45.640
You are unable to remember?

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:50.060
I relive this repeating dream so often...

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:55.360
Yet, when I awake, its meaning eludes me.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.950
When you have convalesced,

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.990
we shall discuss the true nature of our situation.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.830
Slowly and in great detail...

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:14.000
If I were to reveal everything in a single instant, I am certain that...

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.380
you would consider me abnormal.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.380
Are you in pain?

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.300
No. It merely feels unnatural.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.720
You will grow accustomed to it in time.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.680
The only information I can give you at this moment...

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.180
is that you and I...

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.060
are bound together by an unbreakable bond;

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:39.690
one that surpasses any that exists between a man and woman in this world.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:52.750
What is that?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.920
An air raid siren.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:57.830
Japan is currently at war with America.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.460
America.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.230
Someone's approaching.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.190
They are advancing this way.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.400
Who could it be?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.270
Our pursuers.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.730
We are being hunted?

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:28.700
Take this.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.260
Run!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.650
So you've returned to Tokyo,

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.530
Miss Kuromitsu.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:28.990
H-Help me!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:39.250
Kuro.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.620
I am relieved that you are unharmed.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.290
They're over there!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:45.840
Let us leave this place.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.550
I'm certain...

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.550
this scene has...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.680
occurred before.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.060
Concealed by the dark...

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.690
have I not escaped with this woman once before?

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.280
No, more than that.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:18.410
Has this scene not repeated itself for centuries?

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.050
Then, should I not...

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.260
remember those instances?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.410
Kuro.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.090
It is wondrous.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.130
Wondrous?

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:17.300
Yes, it is.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:22.810
Humans are no longer polluting the atmosphere.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:27.350
Extinction can no longer visit any living creature.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.030
Kuromitsu.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.500
Are you awake?

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:01.630
Who are you?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:05.010
I'm Rai. I'm a friend of Karuta, the guy you met yesterday.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.430
You passed out, so I gave you a little checkup.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.730
Do you remember what happened yesterday?

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.270
I mean, what you did to those Red Army guys?

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:28.660
They probably won't let it go, you know.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.910
They'll come looking for revenge.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:33.500
There could be a lot of casualties.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.540
You'd better take responsibility for it, don't you think?

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:38.920
Responsibility?

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:45.220
By becoming one of the Haniwa.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:53.350
Where are you off to?

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:55.940
Watch out!

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:59.480
There's electricity running through that thing.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:00.230
Be careful.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:01.480
You could have died.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.360
Come and sit with me.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.830
Why don't we chat for a bit?

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.080
Wait there, I'll get you something to drink.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.010
Are you looking for something?

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:31.930
Not really.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.890
The correct answer is: "I'm looking for the snake that's just woken up from hibernation."

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.480
There you go.

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:47.070
It feels as though an era has passed since I have lived with another person.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.990
No. Perhaps it was merely a dream

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.790
I cannot differentiate.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.750
You sure are a strange one.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.330
How about your drink? It's getting cold.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.840
Or maybe...

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.300
you'd prefer some human blood?

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:10.640
I'm pretty sure...

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.470
you weren't human yesterday.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:15.720
That makes you a monster, right?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:20.600
Please excuse me. I have errands to run.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.360
About Kuromitsu, right?

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.440
You're looking for her, aren't you?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.160
You know of her?

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:33.160
We can give you information about Kuromitsu.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.450
But that's only if you become one of us.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.710
My apologies, but I cannot join.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:53.680
If you change your mind, go to the butcher shop with an emblem of a snake's head above it.

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:57.930
It's the only place you can find what you want to know.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:14.700
I've read the reports.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:17.410
It's a bit hard to swallow, Rai.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.170
You only say that because you haven't seen the state of Sakafune.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.920
That Kuro kid has some muscle.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.550
He's probably a phony. He's not to be trusted.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.930
Even if he is the real thing...

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:34.350
The real thing? What do you mean by that, Izana?

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.760
If he shows up, bring him to my room.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.560
Dismissed!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.010
You looking for something?

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:09.800
Not really.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.970
I'm looking for the snake that's just woken up from hibernation.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.140
So, you're Kuro, huh?

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:38.030
So you came after all. This way.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:43.330
Kuon.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.630
He has business with Izana?

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.340
You sure brought a dirty rat in this time.

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.380
All right, you may enter.

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.090
Izana's been waiting for you.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:58.050
Hold on a minute. I'll take that sword off you.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:02.270
He's allowed to keep it!

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.940
Izana has already given his permission.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.270
Don't disobey his orders.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:09.360
Carry on, Kuro. He's through that door.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:18.450
Let me go.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.410
So, you're Kuro then?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.670
My name is Izana.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.090
I'm in charge here.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.630
Are you cold?

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.430
This is the temperature required to safeguard the Miitsu.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:39.890
The Miitsu?

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.890
Something that must never be found.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.060
What is it you want me to do?

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:51.110
You could call it demon slaying.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:58.410
The Red Army is obsessed in its pursuit of the secret to eternal life.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.580
They kidnap people in order to conduct experiments to that end.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.790
Much blood has been spilled.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.960
Experiments?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.130
Blood. All for blood.

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.960
Kuro, we need power.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:18.260
If you fight alongside us, we will let you see her.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.470
Kuromitsu.

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.160
The secret basement?

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:43.950
Yeah, it seems Izana intends to take him down there.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.200
Even though he's always refused to show us that place?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.370
Who exactly is Kuro?

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:33.170
Twenty years ago, Kuromitsu was taken from this place.

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:37.760
The Red Army planned to use her blood to create an army of fiends.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:43.590
That's why we must recover her from them.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.390
That is our ultimate goal.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:51.190
Kuro, if you want Kuromitsu back, join us and fight!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.820
Of what madness do you speak?

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:01.070
You are suggesting that the Red Army captured Kuromitsu?

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:03.240
Cease your lies.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:04.950
What did you say?

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.660
This farce shall end this instant!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:10.120
You are the ones that seized her, are you not?!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.290
That day...

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.960
it was not the Red Army that wrested Kuromitsu from my hand.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.800
It was you.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:30.770
It seems as though you are the real Kuro after all.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:36.690
You're correct. We're the ones hiding her.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:42.280
Her blood is a weapon. We can't let it fall into enemy ha–

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:47.200
I do not trust your words.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:49.370
Bring Kuromitsu to me first!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.500
Only then shall we talk.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.210
You seem ignorant of your own situation.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.500
Vampire.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.670
If you refuse to cooperate,

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.630
this is where your life ends.

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.520
Stop it, both of you!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.900
Listen, Kuro.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.610
Only Saniwa can decide whether you meet Kuromitsu.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.700
It all depends on your actions.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.410
Lower your sword.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:44.130
Karuta, you were listening, weren't you?

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:46.300
Ah, you noticed me.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.430
Take Kuro to Saniwa tomorrow.

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.100
Got it.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:54.140
But... is this really all right?

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:58.310
Bringing a stranger to meet her...

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:28.170
Saniwa
